{"4443420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TETE", "steam_appid": 4443420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TETE</strong> is a climbing action game where a tiny golem scales a floating castle in the sky.<br>You control each of its physics-driven arms separately, making movement intentionally tricky and satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443420/extras/35924b6ea66ab7ef6e1b3c9d09f2c00e.poster.avif?t=1787307765\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443420/extras/35924b6ea66ab7ef6e1b3c9d09f2c00e.webm?t=1787307765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443420/extras/35924b6ea66ab7ef6e1b3c9d09f2c00e.mp4?t=1787307765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grab onto ledges, swing, jump, and glide — use a variety of actions to make your way toward the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you’re free to explore even the hidden back sides of the map.<br>Search for secret items, sneak into forbidden areas, and move freely wherever your curiosity takes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Physics-Based Action / Climbing / Action Adventure<br><strong>Players:</strong> Single-player</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TETE</strong> is a climbing action game where a tiny golem scales a floating castle in the sky.<br>You control each of its physics-driven arms separately, making movement intentionally tricky and satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it